---
// input: None (static Privacy Policy page with Google AdSense and analytics compliance)
// output: Comprehensive Privacy Policy meeting modern compliance and SEO standards
// pos: src/pages/privacy.astro (更新规则：文件变更需同步本注释与所属目录 README)

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const structuredData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "@id": "https://soulvirtues.org/privacy/#webpage",
  "url": "https://soulvirtues.org/privacy/",
  "name": "Privacy Policy - Soul Virtues Extractor",
  "description": "Privacy Policy for Soul Virtues Extractor (soulvirtues.org). Transparent client-side processing, no account required, and local data protection.",
  "inLanguage": "en",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "@id": "https://soulvirtues.org/#website",
    "name": "Soul Virtues Extractor",
    "url": "https://soulvirtues.org/"
  }
};
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Soul Virtues Extractor"
  description="Privacy Policy for Soul Virtues Extractor (soulvirtues.org). Transparent client-side processing, no account required, and local data protection."
  canonicalUrl="https://soulvirtues.org/privacy/"
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white font-mono mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs font-mono">Last Updated: August 31, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pixel-card p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Soul Virtues Extractor ("we", "our", or "the website") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains our policies regarding data handling when you use our website (soulvirtues.org).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">2. Client-Side Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Our 66-question test and score calculation operate locally on your device using client-side JavaScript. We do not store, collect, or transmit your individual quiz answers, personality results, or scores to any backend servers or databases.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">3. Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          The website uses your browser's local storage (LocalStorage) solely to allow you to pause, resume, or retake the test on your own device. This information remains strictly on your local browser and can be cleared at any time through your browser settings or by clicking "Reset" on the quiz page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">4. Analytics and Performance Tools</h2>
        <p>
          To understand traffic patterns and optimize user experience, we utilize third-party analytics services:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 mt-2 pl-2 text-gray-400">
          <li><strong class="text-gray-200">Google Analytics:</strong> Collects aggregated, non-personally identifiable telemetry such as browser type, referring pages, session duration, and approximate geographic region.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-200">Microsoft Clarity:</strong> Captures anonymous user behavioral metrics and heatmaps to improve navigation and interface clarity.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-200">Cloudflare Pages & Security Logs:</strong> Processes standard request metadata (including IP address and request timestamps) strictly for DDoS mitigation and global edge performance.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">5. Cookies and Third-Party Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
        <p>
          We may serve advertisements through Google AdSense and affiliated certified ad networks on our website.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 mt-2 pl-2 text-gray-400">
          <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies, web beacons, and unique identifiers to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve targeted ads based on your visits to our site and/or other sites across the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-400 underline font-mono">Google Ads Settings</a> or by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-400 underline font-mono">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">6. User Rights and Global Privacy Regulations</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have specific privacy rights under applicable regulations (such as GDPR for European Economic Area / UK residents, or CCPA/CPRA for California residents):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 mt-2 pl-2 text-gray-400">
          <li><strong class="text-gray-200">EEA / UK Users (GDPR):</strong> You have the right to access, rectify, or erase your personal data, and to manage or withdraw your consent for non-essential cookies through our certified Consent Management Platform (CMP) message prompt.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-200">California Residents (CCPA/CPRA):</strong> We do not sell or share personal information for monetary consideration.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is designed for general audiences and does not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or comments about this Privacy Policy, please reach out via email at:
          <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:contact@soulvirtues.org" class="text-red-400 underline font-mono">contact@soulvirtues.org</a><!--/email_off-->.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
